                                "sense_id": "1eea9262-31a7-30d7-8f0a-b09b76b9e0b8",
                                "text": "But if it stands in humble hame The bed, — I'll say this far in't, — Is clean and feel as ony lair King ever lay on — and that is mair Than mony ane could warrant."
                            }
                        ]
